				<h2>Introduction</h2>
				<p>
					I'm trying to create an English language resource for someone learning
					to play music for
					<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castell">castells</a>. I'm sure
					there's plenty of good stuff online, but as a non-catalan speaker, I
					find it hard to locate, let alone understand! Now, I am not of the
					Catalan culture and I only started taking part in Castells in the
					summer of 2023, so I cannot claim to authentically represent
					traditions and culture. Any mistakes are my own.
				</p>
				<p>
					Thanks to David Vivanco for teaching me all I know about castells
					music.
				</p>
				<p>
					This is a living document. I am editing it over time. Expect things to
					move and shift and change, but please use it for your learning if it
					helps!
				</p>
